The dashboard is intended to prevent unsupported computational claims from
being promoted into the manuscript.


STATUS DEFINITIONS
------------------

GREEN — VERIFIED
    Required artifact and supporting evidence are present and traceable.

BLUE — DOCUMENTED
    Information is explicitly recorded in the recovered study materials,
    but independent execution verification is not yet complete.

YELLOW — PENDING
    The analysis/artifact is required or documented, but supporting execution
    evidence remains incomplete.

RED — NOT RECOVERED
    The required original computational artifact is currently unavailable
    in the recovered repository materials.

GRAY — NOT APPLICABLE
    The artifact is not required for the specific computational stage.


